                                "sense_id": "3fe1b914-dcd7-32b3-8842-e841f4f97c66",
                                "text": "1811, Johannes le Francq van Berkhey, Natuurlyke historie van Holland, vol. 9, publ. P. H. Trap, page 453.\nDe melk wordt … verwerkt tot boter, kaas, karnemelk en hui …,",
                                "translation": "The milk is … processed into butter, cheese, buttermilk and whey …,",
                                "english": "The milk is … processed into butter, cheese, buttermilk and whey …,"
